{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 18, :comments ["<b>What the land is.</b> There is a land that breeds strong men and there is a land that breeds weaklings; there is one that grows a large population and there is one that diminishes a population." "<b>Whether it is strong or weak.</b> He gave them a sign: if they dwell in open towns, they are strong — for they rely on their might; and if they dwell in fortified cities, they are weak (ibid.)."], :book :numbers, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 13, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:10:39.562369360Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}